#. module: l10n_cz_epo
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_epo.field_res_company__l10n_cz_epo_allow_filing
msgid ""
"Off: EPO is used only to CHECK filings (test mode, nothing is filed). On: a "
"queued EPO submission is filed for real. Checking and filing differ by one "
"parameter of the same call, so the difference is enforced here rather than "
"left to habit."
msgstr ""
"Vypnuté: EPO sa používa len na KONTROLU podaní (testovací režim, nič sa "
"nepodá). Zapnuté: podanie EPO vo fronte sa skutočne podá. Kontrola a podanie"
" sa líšia jediným parametrom toho istého volania, preto sa rozdiel vynucuje "
"tu a nenecháva sa na zvyku."

